# CSP STRATEGY — Phase 1 (this deploy):
#   - Removed unused third-party domains from the allowlist:
#     * cdnjs.cloudflare.com       (not used in any source)
#     * cdn.tailwindcss.com        (Tailwind disabled; not loaded)
#     * tovik.app                  (not referenced anywhere)
#     * api.contractai.sa          (not referenced anywhere)
#     * js.sentry-cdn.com          (Sentry only DNS-prefetched in /public/500.html, never script-loaded)
#     * *.sentry.io / o4510966719840256.ingest.us.sentry.io  (Sentry not initialised)
#     * c.bing.com                 (IndexNow is server-side, no browser fetch)
#     * region1.google-analytics.com (duplicate of google-analytics.com)
#   - Kept the actually-loaded domains:
#     * googletagmanager.com + google-analytics.com + stats.g.doubleclick.net  (GA4: G-8LLESL207Q)
#     * clarity.ms + *.clarity.ms  (Microsoft Clarity — loaded when SITE.clarityId is non-empty)
#     * fonts.googleapis.com + fonts.gstatic.com  (IBM Plex Sans Arabic + Inter)
#     * js.hs-scripts.com            (HubSpot tracking — loaded when TRACKING.hubspot is non-empty)
#     * bat.bing.com                 (Bing UET — loaded when TRACKING.bingUet is non-empty)
#     * cdn.mxpnl.com + api.mixpanel.com + *.mixpanel.com  (Mixpanel — when TRACKING.mixpanel is non-empty)
#   NOTE (2026-07-08, Growth Batch): these three growth-stack origins were added to
#   script-src / script-src-elem / connect-src so the conditional MarketingScripts
#   (HubSpot / Bing UET / Mixpanel) execute once real IDs are configured. They stay
#   inert while IDs are empty placeholders (no network request is made).
#   - frame-src extended with https://www.google.com  (Google Maps iframe in /contact/)
#   - Kept 'unsafe-inline' on script-src / script-src-elem / script-src-attr / style-src:
#     * Astro BaseLayout uses <script is:inline> for GA/Clarity init (deferred pageview).
#     * Kernel pages (KernelLayout, kernel/index, kernel/chat, kernel/audit, kernel/approvals,
#       kernel/reports, kernel/scenarios, kernel/connectors) use <script is:inline define:vars={...}>
#       for data injection. Removing unsafe-inline would break Kernel interactive demos.
#     * Astro scoped styles are emitted inline by the build pipeline.
#
# CSP STRATEGY — Phase 2 (next, requires user approval):
#   - Replace 'unsafe-inline' on script-src with per-request nonce-based CSP.
#   - Requires Astro middleware to inject nonce into BaseLayout and re-write every
#     is:inline script to reference the nonce. High blast radius (~30 files).
#   - Will be a separate audit pass with per-page console verification.
#
# HSTS:
#   max-age=63072000 (2 years), includeSubDomains; preload.
#   To enable browser preload, submit the domain once at https://hstspreload.org.
# ==============================================================================

